WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.180
Imagine 10,000 pounds sitting in a
savings account for a whole year.

2
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.360
At the end of that year, many Muslims
would give 250 pounds of it away.

3
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.540
Not as a favour.

4
00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.870
Not as a tip.

5
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.010
As a duty, every single year.

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.010
And they say it doesn't spoil the rest.

7
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.170
It makes the rest pure.

8
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.120
How can giving money away
make what you keep pure?

9
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.710
In this mission, you'll meet zakah,
one of the Five Pillars of Islam.

10
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.720
Then you'll work out how much is
due, and on which kinds of wealth.

11
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:37.490
Your mission: explain how giving part
of your savings away could make the rest

12
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.190
pure.
